  "title": "NiSource to release first quarter 2026 financial results and host conference call on May 6",
  "summary": "MERRILLVILLE, Ind. &ndash; NiSource Inc. (NYSE: NI) today announced that the company will release first quarter 2026 financial results on May 6, 2026, before US financial markets open and will host a conference call that day at 11 a.m. ET (10 a.m. CT) to review first quarter 2026 financial results and provide a general business update.",
